        <div class="note" style="margin-top: 24px; max-width: 60ch;">
            <strong>iPhone 13 Pro, iPhone X, iPhone 6, iPhone 5s, and every item under
            Accessories</strong> use images hotlinked from
            <a href="https://dummyjson.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DummyJSON</a>,
            a free placeholder REST API built for prototyping, not stored in this
            repository. Unlike the CC-licensed photos above, DummyJSON publishes no
            explicit image license, its images are almost certainly mirrored real
            product photography being used here the way the whole developer
            community uses this API: for prototyping, not as a rights-cleared
            asset. Swap these for licensed photography before any real deployment.
        </div>

